## Purpose

The owner rejects the narrow760pxpane and separate opaque text backplates.
Use a full central1344px/viewport-bounded column below the awning, with themed
cream/green glass around all reading content. Double all production blob motion
and prove sustained live behavior rather than only initial render success.

