## Acceptance criteria

- The glass encloses all content columns; no unrelated dark text rectangles.
- Parent cream/green colour changes carry through the pane without a fixed white wash.
- No floating motion button covers reading text.
- Visible-window blur/return and an offscreen footer control never stop ambient movement.
- Open viewers retain continuous ambient motion and native pointers; shortcut Pause needs no viewer closure.
- Explicit Pause, reduced motion, entrance, hidden tabs and resource safety are respected.
- Every published change receives live checks; existing148photos and local study remain unchanged.

